# R2 on the GPU window (W4-WIN-CLOSE C2): a visible dissolve that has not completed keeps the change
# "not on the GPU" until it is done. Run with --gpu and ANNO_VIEW_FADE_MS=3000 (the chunk dissolve).
# A view of chunks that are not on the GPU while uploads are held gets placeholders; the edit's chunk
# replaces one when the uploads are released and dissolves in over the fade time.
look 1052 444
key b
select 1307
rotate 0
wait frames 90
# Zoom in, so that the view is small and a jump of 150 tiles lands on chunks never uploaded.
wheel 6
wait frames 150
hold uploads
look 1204 510
wait frames 60
click 1204 510
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
wait visibility NotOnGpu
expect held uploads
checkpoint dissolve_placeholder
release uploads
checkpoint dissolve_released
wait frames 20
expect visibility NotOnGpu
checkpoint dissolving
# Input meanwhile too: the sim goes on while the dissolve runs.
click 1228 510
wait outcome
expect outcome Applied
checkpoint dissolving_second_edit
wait drawn
expect visibility Visible
checkpoint dissolved
quit
